<title>USA: Akorn completes relocation of offices to Illinois.</title>
<headline>Akorn completes relocation of offices to Illinois.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Akorn Inc  on Tuesday said it completed relocation of its ophthalmic division and corporate headquarters to Lincolnshire from Abita Springs, Louisiana.</p>
<p>Last April, the company had taken a $1.5 million charge against its 1997 first-quarter earnings to cover costs of the relocation.</p>
<p>Akorn makes and markets sterile ophthalmic and injectable pharmaceuticals, and it markets and distributes ophthalmic products.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
